Description:
  OIagent-coworker is an OIagent sub-project that derives selected modules from
  OpenWorker (a Slack/GitHub/Linear/Notion/Calendar AI coworker runtime) and
  adapts them for OIagent daemon-side use. The derivation is module-level,
  not a fork-of-record: each derived module is re-licensed under MIT by the
  OIagent Project Contributors, and the original OpenWorker copyright is
  preserved in the module header and aggregated here.

  OIagent-coworker is NOT a redistribution of OpenWorker in its entirety. It
  is a curated subset selected by the OIagent team under the terms of the
  MIT License. The OIagent project is the sole maintainer of this repository
  and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the OpenWorker
  upstream project or its sponsors.

