B. Derived From (OpenWorker, MIT)
================================================================================

  Name:        OpenWorker
  Repository:  https://github.com/andrewyng/openworker
  License:     MIT (see ./LICENSE-OPENWORKER)
  Copyright:   2024-2026 Andrew Ng and OpenWorker contributors

  Modules derived (selected subset, see section C for per-file header notes):
    - openworker.engine          (async task engine)
    - openworker.mcp             (MCP client bridge)
    - openworker.skills          (skill loader & registry)
    - openworker.connectors      (Slack / GitHub / Linear / Notion / Calendar)
    - openworker.server          (FastAPI HTTP server)

  Modules NOT derived (intentionally excluded from OIagent-coworker scope):
    - SaaS / multi-tenant routing
    - Vendor lock-in adapters (closed-source LLM routing)
    - Cloud-managed auth flows

  Per the MIT License, the original OpenWorker copyright notice and this
  permission notice must accompany any substantial portion of the derived
  code. The full text is reproduced in LICENSE-OPENWORKER.

