W2 MODULES (2026-08-02)
================================================================================
  The following modules were extracted from openworker during W2 (P1 phase)
  and live under the oiagent_coworker.* namespace. Each carries a full
  SPDX header per scripts/module_header_template.py.

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.engine
    — W2-1.1: Derived from openworker.agent.permissions.PermissionMode
      five-state machine. Replaced upstream ASYNC/COMPACTION with
      OIagent-specific SYNC/PLAN/INTERRUPT. StandingRule task-scoped
      auth added; risk tiering uses oiagent_coworker.permissions
      namespace only.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02 (commit 01b6f83b)

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.path_sandbox
    — W2-1.2: Borrowed path containment logic from openworker.path_sandbox.
      Rewrote is_within_workspace() for OIagent workspace_root parameter.
      Symlink/hardlink escape detection added.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.shell_classifier
    — W2-1.2: Adapted openworker.agent.tools.bash.classify_command().
      Extended regex list for PowerShell / cmd.exe / fish.
      Removed upstream run_command() execution path entirely.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.standing_rule
    — W2-1.3: Conceptual borrow from openworker standing_rule.
      TTL shortened from 1h → 15min. Storage: JSONL (was JSON).
      Remove upstream accumulate() idempotency.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.audit
    — W2-1.4: Replaced upstream (args, kwargs) duck-type sink with
      typed AuditSink Protocol + AuditDecision tagged-union envelope.
      Added facade adapters for each subsystem.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.inbox.models
  oiagent_coworker.inbox.service
  oiagent_coworker.inbox.persistence
    — W2-2: 5 item types from openworker.inbox.items.py. Replaced
      SQLite backend with JSONL append-only store. Removed upstream
      Slack/GitHub/Linear/Notion/Calendar source enum.
      idempotency_key: blake2b-256 (was sha1).
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.selfwake.models
  oiagent_coworker.selfwake.scheduler
  oiagent_coworker.selfwake.persistence
    — W2-3: Trigger three-state abstraction from openworker.triggers.
      Replaced upstream croniter dependency with simplified CRON match.
      tick() synchronous; no asyncio / background thread runtime.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.persona.models
  oiagent_coworker.persona.service
  oiagent_coworker.persona.persistence
    — W2-4: Registry + lazy import from openworker.personas.
      Dropped PersonaProvider.openai.Anthropic / OpenAI classes.
      YAML frontmatter via yaml.safe_load (was yaml.load unsafe).
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.skills.models
  oiagent_coworker.skills.service
  oiagent_coworker.skills.persistence
    — W2-5: Registry + JSONL persistence from openworker.skills.
      Dropped upstream stage_confirm Tauri dialog (re-implemented as
      OIagent-only gate in W2-5.2) and aisuite integration.
      UUID4 hex (32-char) for skill_id.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.skills.loader
    — W2-5.1: SKILL.md folder-as-truth loader with global/project/user
      scope resolution. YAML frontmatter parsing mirrors
      oiagent_coworker.persona.persistence (regex + yaml.safe_load).
      Dropped upstream folder-as-truth heuristics; reimplemented for
      OIagent workspace_root pinning and pytest-safe fixtures.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.policy_gate
    — P0-3 / W2-7: New file; no upstream counterpart. PolicyGate compat
      layer routing between legacy PolicyEngine (duck-typed) and the new
      OIagentCoworkerPermissionEngine. Shadow-mode verdict diffing;
      enforce-mode fallback-to-legacy. Header per module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-02

  oiagent_coworker.skills.stage_confirm
    — W2-5.2: New file; no upstream counterpart. Stage-confirm gate
      translating skills upload/invoke into a duck-typed PolicyGate.check()
      call (P0-3 §5 compat layer) instead of the upstream Tauri dialog.
      Emits zero audit records of its own; audit flows through the
      injected gate. Header per module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-03

  oiagent_coworker.skills.manifest
    — W2-5.3: New file; no upstream counterpart. SKILL.md markdown-body
      digest (title/sections/200-char digest) — the body parsing that
      loader.py explicitly defers — plus the e2e_overlay frontmatter
      declaration check. skills_root is caller-injected; the module
      never resolves ${OIAGENT_VAULT} and never imports
      oiagent.vault.path. Emits zero audit records (stage_confirm
      convention). capability-04 E2E overlay mounted as a test fixture
      at tests/fixtures/skills/capability-04-e2e/SKILL.md; the daemon
      places the real file at the vault path at deploy time.
      Header per module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-03

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.consistency
    — W3-1: New file; no upstream counterpart. Shadow-mode verdict-diff
      consistency analyzer: rolling agreement metric (engine-heartbeat
      denominator), per-field mismatch classification (allow /
      requires_approval / risk_level / mode / new_engine_error), and
      the W3 Phase C shadow→enforce flip-criterion check. Consumes an
      injected iterable of kind="permission" audit-envelope dicts;
      pure analysis — zero I/O, zero audit emission, injected
      evaluation instant. Header per module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-03

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.audit_stream
    — W3-2: New file; no upstream counterpart. Audit-stream persistence
      + ingestion layer: a standalone append-only JSONL sink
      (fsync-per-line, lazy create) conforming to the AuditSink
      Protocol, plus a tolerant single-pass reader feeding the W3-1
      consistency analyzer. Read-side timestamp pre-filter is a coarse
      I/O optimization only; the analyzer window is authoritative.
      Reader emits zero audit; no clock read; stream_path injected as a
      Path (no vault resolution, no env vars). Upstream commit:
      not present (W3-2 is OIagent-only). Header per
      module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-03

  oiagent_coworker.permissions.audit_tee
    — W3-3: New file; no upstream counterpart. Two-leg audit tee
      (FanoutAuditSink) composing the W3-2 AuditStreamSink primary leg
      (invoked FIRST) with the external P2_10 secondary leg (invoked
      SECOND) behind the sealed single-sink facade, with per-leg failure
      isolation. Also carries the observation-window wiring recipe and the
      daily_flip_probe.py deployment entry-point. Upstream commit: not
      present (W3-3 is OIagent-only). Header per module_header_template.py.
    — Last reviewed upstream: 2026-08-03

